+| connect-dynamodb 3.0.5 | `node_modules/connect-dynamodb/LICENSE.txt`；`README.md:167` | “connect-dynamodb is licensed under the [MIT license.]”；“Copyright (c) 2025 introvert.com LLC” | 随包正文确认 MIT |
